From: Codex local A376B compatibility adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] Port A376B APE and personalization disablement

Reason: product-tail-after-input.txt:94-95 fails the old CONNECTION_PERSONALIZATION diff at SemWifiInjector.smali:1641. AZH4 changed constructor register layout, APE SEP version, Qbox key and SQE command class. Adapt reviewed constructor region to null APE fields, disable the exact personalization/L4s default, stop Qbox's APE observer and dispatch its disabled message. Split only SUPPORT_APE ordinal35 out of its shared shell switch target. Disable the moved develop/ApePreferenceController and reset default. Old ape map entries are absent and checked, rather than editing unrelated booleans. Scan UI retention remains separate.
Files: unica/patches/product_feature/customize.sh; unica/patches/product_feature/wifi/a376b_backend.py.
Verification: exact constructor-region and Qbox-method hashes, no external references to removed labels, actual enum/dispatch checks, all-or-nothing fixtures (unknown enum rejected), actual donor preflight PASS4changedclasses. APK assembly/compiled behavior/full build and runtime remain required; revert0051.

---
--- a/unica/patches/product_feature/customize.sh
+++ b/unica/patches/product_feature/customize.sh
@@ -959,7 +959,16 @@
 if [[ "$SOURCE_WLAN_CONFIG_CONNECTION_PERSONALIZATION" != "$TARGET_WLAN_CONFIG_CONNECTION_PERSONALIZATION" ]] || \
         [[ "$SOURCE_WLAN_CONFIG_DYNAMIC_SWITCH" != "$TARGET_WLAN_CONFIG_DYNAMIC_SWITCH" ]] || \
         [[ "$SOURCE_WLAN_SUPPORT_APE_SERVICE" != "$TARGET_WLAN_SUPPORT_APE_SERVICE" ]]; then
-    if [[ "$SOURCE_WLAN_CONFIG_CONNECTION_PERSONALIZATION" == "1" ]] && $SOURCE_WLAN_SUPPORT_APE_SERVICE; then
+    if [ "${ROM_SOURCE_CONFIG:-}" = "essi_a376b_android16" ] && \
+            [ "$TARGET_CODENAME" = "star2lte" ] && \
+            [ "$SOURCE_WLAN_CONFIG_CONNECTION_PERSONALIZATION" = "1" ] && \
+            [ "$TARGET_WLAN_CONFIG_CONNECTION_PERSONALIZATION" = "0" ] && \
+            [ "$SOURCE_WLAN_CONFIG_DYNAMIC_SWITCH" = "0" ] && \
+            [ "$TARGET_WLAN_CONFIG_DYNAMIC_SWITCH" = "0" ] && \
+            [ "$SOURCE_WLAN_SUPPORT_APE_SERVICE" = "true" ] && \
